OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'horrified' over granddad's
OL,4,Afour-day ED bed wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 72-year-old man who
OL,7,Fspent several days sitting in a chair
OL,8,Fin Altnagelvin Hospital's Emergency
OL,9,FDepartment (ED) while waiting for a bed
OL,10,Fsaid they had been left feeling
OL,11,F"helpless and horrified."
OL,13,FMike Kelly was taken by ambulance to
OL,14,Fthe Londonderry hospital on 6 September
OL,15,Fwith an infection in his foot and after
OL,16,Fhaving an angina attack at home.
OL,18,FHis granddaughter Enya Kelly said for
OL,19,Ffour days he sat in a chair in an ED
OL,20,Fhallway, was in "excruciating pain" and
OL,21,Fwas unable to get any sleep.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
