OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'horrified' over granddad's
OL,4,Afour-day ED bed wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Western Health and Social Care
OL,7,FTrust (WHSCT) has apologised to
OL,8,Fpatients who have been facing long
OL,9,Fwaits at the hospital.
